PLACARD is open hardware and open software.  Each kind of work has the
license written for it; the full texts are in the LICENSES folder.

Hardware: CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Strongly Reciprocal
(SPDX: CERN-OHL-S-2.0, LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt)

    kicad/          schematics, boards, project library, fab outputs
    schematics/     schematic PDFs and drawings
    case/           case models, plates and print files
    src/pld/        PLD equations (WinCUPL)
    src/hdl/        VHDL model of the machine
    src/sim/        VHDL test benches
    src/constraints/, src/ip/   FPGA build of the model

